{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33816","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 沪 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 沪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"波中植甚固，磔磔如鰕须。\n涛头倏尔过，数顷跳鯆䱐。\n不是细罗密，自爲朝夕驱。\n空怜指鱼命，遣出海边租。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}